Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{chapter - Shinnosuke's Happiness}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:17.22,0:00:20.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, wait. Easy now. Sit.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:20.89,0:00:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Shake. The other one. {?? guessing about the first one, okawari means "change" so probably "give me your other hand"} {that's the common use for okawari in dog training, yes}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:24.63,0:00:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. Stay.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:28.70,0:00:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,All right! {/go}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:35.34,0:00:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor Shinnosuke. \NHe has to go through all that just to get fed.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:39.94,0:00:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Compared to that, Michael has it easy.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:44.58,0:00:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm home.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:46.05,0:00:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you behave, Shinnosuke? Good boy. {?} {more or less accurate}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:48.85,0:00:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? They gave you leftovers again?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:52.02,0:00:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandpa, it's always \Nnothing but leftovers with you!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:54.52,0:00:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I've told you to give him proper food.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:57.46,0:01:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Dogs eating leftovers\Nis how it's always been. {since ancient times}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:00.41,0:01:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You're always like this!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:02.20,0:01:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Shinnosuke's family too, you know!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:04.10,0:01:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,He's my little brother!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:07.10,0:01:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he take you for a walk today?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:16.98,0:01:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, dear{Grandma}, you took him \Nout today, didn't you?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:20.48,0:01:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought {\i1}you{\i0}{\i0\fsp3} {\fsp0}took him out.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:22.87,0:01:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:23.65,0:01:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Shinnosuke, you poor thing!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:35.60,0:01:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,This is not for you!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:40.00,0:01:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Shinnosuke! \NPremium beef-flavored dog food.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:44.14,0:01:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Here you go, stuff yourself.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:57.58,0:02:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't just get excited. Hurry up and eat.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:06.28,0:02:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, please! You can't just jump around in excitement! You've gotta eat it too!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:12.13,0:02:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, so you're {\i1}that{\i0}{\i0\fsp3} {\fsp0}happy?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:13.37,0:02:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,When you get too happy, \Nyou can't even eat?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:16.37,0:02:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What'll I do with you?\N Okay, then have this instead.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:18.84,0:02:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead, Shinnosuke.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:24.01,0:02:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It's for you, see?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:34.12,0:02:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,W-Where are you going?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:44.36,0:02:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you burying it in a place like that?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:50.44,0:02:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I gave you that fancy treat, \Nand you're chewing on a stick?!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:53.54,0:02:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so damn cheap! {petty; small-minded; stingy}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:01.38,0:03:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Shinnosuke, it's walk time!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:03.28,0:03:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Lead the way! {???? not a clue} {this vaguely sounds like 歩き出して！which would mean it's a good enough TL}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:05.24,0:03:07.29,Default,,0,0,0,,There you go, Shinnosuke!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:40.99,0:03:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Shinnosuke, stop it! \NHey, cut it out!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:43.87,0:03:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do I even keep telling him \Nnot to bark at everything like that?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:49.63,0:03:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:51.06,0:03:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Gee, did you really bury \Nall that stuff here, Shinnosuke?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:54.20,0:03:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,This was Shinnosuke's secret treasure spot, \Na place where he hid his precious things.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:59.22,0:04:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And then Michael goes and messes with it! \NHe dug everything up.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:04.18,0:04:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Apologize to Shinnosuke now!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:07.21,0:04:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:08.78,0:04:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Thsese are my reading glasses!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:10.92,0:04:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I was wondering where I'd lost them.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:13.76,0:04:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,A gateball ball and garden shears…
Dialogue: 10,0:04:16.86,0:04:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You stupid Shinnosuke!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:18.43,0:04:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:19.53,0:04:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,This dog is hopeless.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:21.10,0:04:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hiding our precious things in a place like this… \NWhy can't you just behave normally?! {/stop playing pranks}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:25.70,0:04:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it! \NIt's not like Shinnosuke meant any harm.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:29.00,0:04:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? What's this?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:30.77,0:04:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa... Is that...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:33.60,0:04:35.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Shinnosuke, you idiot!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:35.39,0:04:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandpa valued those glasses! \NDon't you know when to stop?!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:41.10,0:04:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, Grandpa? Grandma?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:52.08,0:04:55.56,Song,,0,0,0,,What's Michael? \NWhat's Michael?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:55.56,0:04:58.23,Song,,0,0,0,,You too will be number one someday
Dialogue: 10,0:04:58.23,0:05:01.77,Song,,0,0,0,,What's Michael?\NWhat's Michael?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:01.77,0:05:04.61,Song,,0,0,0,,Now which one is number one?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:04.61,0:05:07.51,Song,,0,0,0,,What's Michael? Number one!
Comment: 0,0:05:08.09,0:05:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{chapter - The Visitor of Terror}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:22.99,0:05:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, it's gone.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:26.98,0:05:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Michael! \NI'm busy, so move it.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:30.40,0:05:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not here. \NWhere on Earth did I put it?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:34.17,0:05:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hurry up, or you'll be late.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:36.12,0:05:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:37.38,0:05:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, stop it, Michael!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:40.94,0:05:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael! What the hell are you doing \Nwhen I'm this busy?!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:44.78,0:05:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine. I'll clean it up.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:46.68,0:05:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:58.96,0:06:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael! I said go away! \NHow many times do I have to tell you?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:03.40,0:06:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Found it! The diamond ring!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:05.34,0:06:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you really trying that hard \Nto show off at your class reunion?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:08.20,0:06:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you say something?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:09.44,0:06:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,No, nothing.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:11.34,0:06:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael-chan, it's all thanks to you!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:14.91,0:06:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That{\i0},{\i0\fsp3} {\fsp0}for smashing the vase? {lit: in exchange for that - meaning that michael smashed the vase but still gets praised}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:17.85,0:06:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, there you are!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:24.55,0:06:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what are you doing? \NYou've got to... {/you've no time}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:26.68,0:06:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:06:27.32,0:06:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:06:29.62,0:06:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, th-that's...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:31.62,0:06:34.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, what's this money?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:34.19,0:06:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's, uh...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:35.66,0:06:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would you hide something like this?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:37.76,0:06:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine. Then I'll use this money \Nto splurge at today's reunion.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:41.20,0:06:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,No, wait...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:42.70,0:06:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael-chan, you really are such a smart fellow! I'm in love with it!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:49.01,0:06:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm heading out now, \Nso be a good boy and watch the house.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:52.05,0:06:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,And keep an eye on this man \Nso he doesn't do anything bad.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:54.88,0:06:55.85,Default,,0,0,0,,See you later, dear.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:55.85,0:06:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,H-Hey, w-what about that 30,000 yen?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:58.49,0:07:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye-bye.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:14.47,0:07:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:23.14,0:07:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just going out to do some shopping. \NBe a good boy and watch the house.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:43.36,0:07:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:46.90,0:07:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:39.35,0:09:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:42.15,0:09:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:46.55,0:09:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Come here.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:49.62,0:09:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You dummy, there's no need to cry.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:53.29,0:09:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm home!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:55.20,0:09:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:56.05,0:09:57.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, I'm beat.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:57.93,0:10:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? You're back pretty early.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:00.43,0:10:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Well, I thought about it on the way\Nand remembered the reunion's actually tomorrow.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:04.60,0:10:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Aren't you scatterbrained!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:09.02,0:10:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Michael? \NWhy are you so worked up?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:12.51,0:10:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you believe it? I had an errand too, \Nso I stepped out for a bit.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:15.75,0:10:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,But when I got back, \Nhe suddenly clung to me and started bawling.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:19.47,0:10:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,My, aren't you a needy little thing? {lit: a person who gets lonely easily}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:23.17,0:10:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,He probably had a scary dream.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:26.46,0:10:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,So cute.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:30.60,0:10:32.48,Thought,,0,0,0,,Serves you right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.56,0:10:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(0,0)\p1\c&H010A04&}m 0 0 l 640 0 640 480 0 480{\p0}
Comment: 0,0:10:41.62,0:10:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{chapter - How to Train Your Cat}{resume}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:52.02,0:10:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,There, Rocky!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:56.57,0:10:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Good! Come on, Rocky.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:01.96,0:11:04.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, good boy, Rocky.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:11.84,0:11:13.14,Thought,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:13.89,0:11:14.51,Thought,,0,0,0,,Okay...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:14.51,0:11:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Michael!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:15.84,0:11:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, here we go.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:17.78,0:11:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:21.72,0:11:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Michael!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:23.33,0:11:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Go! Go! Go...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:29.06,0:11:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:11:37.40,0:11:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,See? This is how you fetch it. \NDoesn't it look fun?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:40.30,0:11:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, one more time!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:45.04,0:11:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I get it.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:46.47,0:11:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't like it, we'll stop.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:48.81,0:11:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Then how about we run together? \NCome on, Michael.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:53.15,0:11:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,So? Isn't it fun, Michael?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:06.84,0:12:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You punk!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:09.00,0:12:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with that look? \NIs that how you look at your owner?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:12.13,0:12:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm doing this\N because I value our skinship and... {using the term from OVA subs, otherwise would be "bond"}
Dialogue: 10,0:12:16.12,0:12:18.47,Default,,0,0,0,,H-Hey, wait, I got it.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:18.89,0:12:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, I'll run by myself.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:22.34,0:12:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you feel like running together, \Nyou can join me anytime.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:39.66,0:12:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,If you feel like running together, \Ncome along anytime!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:42.06,0:12:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,No one's forcing you!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:48.10,0:12:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Well? Feel like running now?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:40.29,0:13:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:44.83,0:13:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Michael!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:46.36,0:13:50.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, go, go, go, go!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:50.66,0:13:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I said go!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:52.67,0:13:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:54.03,0:13:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Why can't you ever understand how I feel?!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:00.84,0:14:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,When I was young, I tried to nourish\Nmy skinship with my cat like that too.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:07.16,0:14:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,W-Who are you?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:10.36,0:14:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You may call me a friend of the feline heart. {literal, was "he who knows cats" in manga TL}
Dialogue: 10,0:14:16.01,0:14:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:16.99,0:14:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You're still young. \NThat won't help you understand a cat's feelings.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:24.20,0:14:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:14:28.37,0:14:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You can speak cat?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:32.01,0:14:38.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, after many years of training with cats, \Nnaturally I would reach this level.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:38.51,0:14:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't approach cats \Nwith that kind of demanding attitude. {??? soiu **** taido - probably means that kobayashi only demands his cat to do things for him, giving nothing in return?}　{押し付けがましい - pushy, demanding, etc, basically forcing oneself without consideration}
Dialogue: 10,0:14:42.34,0:14:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It's important to abandon your human heart \Nand melt naturally into a cat's feelings.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:50.09,0:14:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Just watch.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:51.66,0:14:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, please.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:54.86,0:14:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Meow! Meow-go! \NMeow-go, meow-go! Meow-go!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:00.88,0:15:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:15:06.07,0:15:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Meow-go! Meow!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:09.56,0:15:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Meow-go! Meow-go! Meow-go!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:12.83,0:15:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Meow-go! Meow-go! Meow-go!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:17.78,0:15:18.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You dumbass!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:18.65,0:15:19.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:19.99,0:15:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up! {This is how you teach your cat \Nif he just doesn't understand!} This is fine if a cat's just too stubborn! {lit: with stubborn cats like this, this is fine to do}
Dialogue: 10,0:15:23.14,0:15:26.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that?! \NAll you did was nonsense meowing! {unyaunya = mumble meow meow }
Dialogue: 10,0:15:26.23,0:15:28.13,Default,,0,0,0,,No one understood you!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:28.13,0:15:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you know, you greenhorn?! \NWhy should I listen to some punk like you?! {wakazou?} {yes, accurate}
Dialogue: 10,0:15:31.77,0:15:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you've said it, old fart! {?? feeble-minded old man; senile old fool; dotard​} {yes, accurate}
Dialogue: 10,0:15:33.00,0:15:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Who're you calling an old fart?!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:34.55,0:15:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm calling {\i1}you{\i0}{\i0\fsp3} {\fsp0}what you are, an old fart!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:36.44,0:15:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,"A friend of the feline heart"? \NDon't make me laugh!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:39.01,0:15:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! Now you've said \Nwhat you shouldn't have, you brat!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:41.98,0:15:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're so confident, \Ntry eating cat grub every day! {lit: if you're frustrated/seething}{nekomanma}
Dialogue: 10,0:15:44.24,0:15:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't talk like {\i1}you{\i0}{\i0\fsp3} {\fsp0}can do it!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:45.98,0:15:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I can do it anytime, \Nyou fat-lipped fool! {full lips; thick lips}
Dialogue: 10,0:15:48.78,0:15:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you've said it! \NWhat about your own lips?! {????} {自分のことを棚にあげて - the act of ignoring one's disadvantages on purpose, in this case might be about lips, or the whole banter, either should be fine in context as this is just petty squabbling}
Dialogue: 10,0:15:51.02,0:15:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,So what about them, you old fart?!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:52.72,0:15:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Now{\i0}{\i0\fsp3} {\fsp0}you're getting it! \NI'm not taking that from the likes of you! {???} {もう許さん！お前のようなやつは成敗してくれる！honestly current TL is fine as is, the idea is he had enough and about to give it to him}
Dialogue: 10,0:16:00.51,0:16:04.16,Song,,0,0,0,,What's Michael? \NWhat's Michael?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:04.16,0:16:06.66,Song,,0,0,0,,You too will be number one someday
Dialogue: 10,0:16:06.66,0:16:10.20,Song,,0,0,0,,What's Michael?\NWhat's Michael?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:10.20,0:16:13.21,Song,,0,0,0,,Now which one is number one?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:13.21,0:16:15.52,Song,,0,0,0,,What's Michael? Number one!
Comment: 0,0:16:15.52,0:16:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{chapter - The Woof-Meow Marathon}
Dialogue: 10,0:16:22.38,0:16:24.39,Top,,0,0,0,,Blessed with clear skies,
Dialogue: 10,0:16:24.39,0:16:29.06,Top,,0,0,0,,the 3rd annual Woof-Meow Citizens' Marathon \Nis starting any minute now!{should be third, but 3rd is on the sign}
Dialogue: 10,0:16:33.19,0:16:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:16:34.46,0:16:37.43,Top,,0,0,0,,All racers are lined up at the starting line.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:41.07,0:16:43.40,Thought,,0,0,0,,I won't lose. Today's the day!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:43.40,0:16:47.42,Thought,,0,0,0,,For the honor of dogs everywhere, \NMichael, I'm beating you!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:52.78,0:16:56.40,Top,,0,0,0,,And now, at last, the race is about to begin!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:01.09,0:17:02.29,Top,,0,0,0,,They've started!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:02.29,0:17:04.50,Top,,0,0,0,,The lead pack is, as expected, the large breeds.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:04.50,0:17:06.23,Top,,0,0,0,,Dobermans, pointers, and the like.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:06.23,0:17:09.60,Top,,0,0,0,,Following close behind,\Ndachshunds and spitzes are hanging in there!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:11.48,0:17:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, go for it! {??} {not sure either but I feel any random cheering would do}
Dialogue: 10,0:17:14.17,0:17:17.84,Top,,0,0,0,,The lead vehicle is passing now. \NWhoa, it's loaded with cat food!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:19.21,0:17:22.04,Top,,0,0,0,,And behind it, a police bike \Nwith a kitty teaser attached!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:23.21,0:17:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck, Michael!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:23.91,0:17:26.68,Top,,0,0,0,,Looks like the cats are being lured by the food.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:25.98,0:17:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's wrong, Michael?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:33.30,0:17:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The Woof-Meow Citizens' Marathon \Nis now at its zenith.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:37.29,0:17:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Reporting live from the scene, \Nreporter Go Tokuji. {??? can't find his name in wiki and haven't made it to that chapter in manga yet, not sure what his name is exactly, maybe "Gotoku Jin" or something else; there's a buddhist temple called goutokuji} {can't really help with character names but Go Tokuji sounds good enough for me}
Dialogue: 10,0:17:41.33,0:17:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! We can see the runner.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:44.40,0:17:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, you're currently in last place. \NHow do you feel right now?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:49.27,0:17:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:17:50.27,0:17:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh… How does it feel to be last?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:53.24,0:17:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! What about your impressions?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:06.59,0:18:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Catzilla!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:08.15,0:18:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Run away! Hurry!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:17.53,0:18:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Go Tokuji speaking, Go Tokuji speaking... \NHere are the standings at the halfway checkpoint! {??? orikaeshi is usually "returning [in marathon]" so I assume he means "run away and don't turn back at the checkpoint"? }{折り返し地点どうぞ! orikaeshi chiten is literally 'point where you turn back', also generally used as halfway point of something. In this case, he's reporting the race as it hits the literal halfway point}
Dialogue: 10,0:18:25.86,0:18:28.32,Top,,0,0,0,,Shinnosuke is in first place\N at the checkpoint turn!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:28.32,0:18:32.81,Thought,,0,0,0,,All right, first at the turn.\NToday I can finally beat Michael!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:38.67,0:18:41.29,Default,,0,0,0,,That's cheating! \NTurn properly at the checkpoint!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:41.29,0:18:42.06,Thought,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:18:42.06,0:18:45.07,Thought,,0,0,0,,I'm in first! First place! See my skills?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:45.93,0:18:48.93,Top,,0,0,0,,At the water station, the cats are relaxing!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:48.93,0:18:51.70,Top,,0,0,0,,Perhaps long-distance racing \Nwas too much for them?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:51.70,0:18:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, thank you.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:58.54,0:19:01.18,Thought,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna win…\NI'm gonna win…
Dialogue: 10,0:19:01.59,0:19:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep it up, Shinnosuke! It's the final stretch!{???} {しんのすけ！ラストスパートだ！頑張れ！}
Dialogue: 10,0:19:16.39,0:19:18.63,Thought,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:19:29.27,0:19:31.94,Thought,,0,0,0,,I-It's the finish line!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:32.94,0:19:37.68,Thought,,0,0,0,,I... I won!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:45.09,0:19:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing, you idiot?!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:47.92,0:19:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you know what "no entry" means?!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:50.42,0:19:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:19:54.96,0:19:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Now our movie shoot is completely ruined!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:03.79,0:20:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:05.21,0:20:09.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Every time I open my lunchbox on location, \Nmy Catherine shows up without fail!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:18.12,0:20:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, trying to make a run for it?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:20.22,0:20:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:20:22.61,0:20:25.46,Top,,0,0,0,,And now, the finish line is in sight!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:26.54,0:20:29.16,Top,,0,0,0,,We can see the runners approaching!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:30.13,0:20:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder where Michael is?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:31.98,0:20:35.45,Top,,0,0,0,,The crown of victory... Whose will it be?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:38.39,0:20:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! Michael, hang in there!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:52.09,0:20:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:53.37,0:20:54.72,Top,,0,0,0,,Whoa, who's that?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:54.72,0:20:57.67,Top,,0,0,0,,Someone's coming in \Nwith a tremendous last spurt!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:59.14,0:21:01.16,Top,,0,0,0,,It's Michael!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:02.46,0:21:05.90,Top,,0,0,0,,Across the finish line! Michael takes first place!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:05.90,0:21:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:21:06.48,0:21:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow! You did it, Michael!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:11.77,0:21:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Congratulations, Michael!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:15.91,0:21:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.01,0:21:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,
